Apache Spark
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project incorporates the ANTLR grammar from Apache Spark, which is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

  Apache Spark
  Copyright 2014 and onwards The Apache Software Foundation
  https://github.com/apache/spark

Files derived from Apache Spark:

  grammar/vendor/SqlBaseLexer.g4
  grammar/vendor/SqlBaseParser.g4
      Downloaded unmodified from apache/spark. See
      grammar/vendor/MANIFEST.txt for the exact revision and checksums.

  grammar/databricks/SqlBaseLexer.g4
  grammar/databricks/SqlBaseParser.g4
      The above, modified by scripts/patch_grammar.py: Java action code
      rewritten for ANTLR's Python target, and Databricks-specific syntax
      added from grammar/extensions/.

  src/dbsqlparse/generated/
      Parser, lexer, listener and visitor generated by ANTLR from the
      grammars above. Derivative works of the Spark grammar.

