--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Test corpus
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

`make corpus-fetch` downloads SQL test files from the Apache Spark
repository into corpus/cache/. Those files are Apache-2.0 licensed and are
not distributed with this project; they are fetched on demand and the cache
is not committed.
